{"unit_id":"nitrazepam01__dsh-web-search-tavily#card-zh","repo":"nitrazepam01/dsh-web-search-tavily","commit":"4dac8613b8d3f09ba3e24cb9750b93ea1fefd912","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-tavily 是面向 DSH web 客户端的网页搜索插件：它向 ctx.web 注册 Tavily 搜索提供者，并通过 search-switch 按 web-search 设置选择 Tavily 或 DeepSeek 官方搜索后端。主要功能包括调用 Tavily 搜索接口、把结果整理为链接与摘要、在设置中切换搜索后端，以及限制每次搜索的结果数。适合需要让 DSH 助手检索网页信息的用户。使用 Tavily 后端需要配置 TAVILY_API_KEY，搜索查询会发送到 api.tavily.com。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:54-65","lib/index.js:84-109","lib/index.js:161-181","lib/index.js:270-290","cordis.patch.yml:16-25"]}
{"unit_id":"nitrazepam01__dsh-web-search-tavily#card-en","repo":"nitrazepam01/dsh-web-search-tavily","commit":"4dac8613b8d3f09ba3e24cb9750b93ea1fefd912","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-web-search-tavily adds Tavily search to DSH and routes requests through a settings based provider switch. It returns source links and snippets and lets users choose Tavily or DeepSeek official search. Tavily searches require TAVILY_API_KEY and send queries to api.tavily.com.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:54-65","lib/index.js:84-109","lib/index.js:161-181","lib/index.js:270-290","cordis.patch.yml:16-25"]}
